            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-A3, River Rock Collection Arched Mount Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe River Rock Scalloped Mount Towel Bar is a great addition to any bathroom. Select between 18 inch, 24 inch, or a 30 inch towel bar. As part of Fusion's River Rock Collection, it features a simplistic beauty. It is available in either medium bronze or dark bronze finishes.  The Arched Mount Towel Bar is easy to install and comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/arched-wall-mounted-towel-ring-fusion-tr-a3\"><b>Fusion TR-A3 Arched Towel Ring</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/bronze-river-rock-arched-mount-robe-hook-fusion-rh-a3\"><b>Fusion RH-A3 Arched Robe Hook</b></a>, \r\nand <a href=\"/products/arched-mount-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-a3\"><b>Fusion PH-A3 Arched Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-A3</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-A3</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-A3</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
